| Primitive | Wrapper     |
| --------- | ----------- |
| `int`     | `Integer`   |
| `long`    | `Long`      |
| `float`   | `Float`     |
| `double`  | `Double`    |
| `char`    | `Character` |
| `byte`    | `Byte`      |
| `short`   | `Short`     |
| `boolean` | `Boolean`   |

